        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Cement cast plaster floor, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Cement cast plaster floor, at plant
No losses and no waste water have been taken into account. The used cement is "portland cement, strength class Z 42.5, at plant";
Synonyms: estrich; 
UUID: 1c8bab34-ccb6-3f04-9b30-b0beea947c6e
It includes mixing of the raw materials (portland cement, sand and water), casting (either by pump or by bucket), ramming and finishing. Some transports and infrastructure are also included
Location: For some exchanges CH- and RER-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: typical technology for Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1c8bab34-ccb6-3f04-9b30-b0beea947c6e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
